{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04658","headline":"送王尚一严嶷二侍御赴司马都督军 · 张说","name":"送王尚一严嶷二侍御赴司马都督军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉掖通沙塞，边兵护草腓。\n将行司马令，助以铁冠威。\n白露鹰初下，黄尘骑欲飞。\n明年春酒熟，留酌二星归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}